        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CAPPA, a hero from capybara legend, needs your help! Your mission: free every capybara in the world from the evil clutches of Cappyland. But wait... who is that mysterious Stream-Bara lurking in the corner of the screen?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/d627cbdfb89690194b788f5f7ef48c71.poster.avif?t=1768919098\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/d627cbdfb89690194b788f5f7ef48c71.webm?t=1768919098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/d627cbdfb89690194b788f5f7ef48c71.mp4?t=1768919098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To help you complete CAPPA’s mission, you’ll use an artifact known only from ancient tales – <strong>the Ropegun</strong>. Use your fluffy body and springy rope to bounce through various traps and dangers trying to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/75d10e5d75557691a0593049b0242cab.poster.avif?t=1768919098\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/75d10e5d75557691a0593049b0242cab.webm?t=1768919098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/75d10e5d75557691a0593049b0242cab.mp4?t=1768919098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stream-Bara has gathered the Capy-Chat – the audience of his stream, reacting live to your playthrough. You can impress them by looking cool and beating the game with ease… or rage and be memed in chat! It’s all in your hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/8fd3cc79f232f2884bfa193d49641f33.poster.avif?t=1768919098\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/8fd3cc79f232f2884bfa193d49641f33.webm?t=1768919098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/8fd3cc79f232f2884bfa193d49641f33.mp4?t=1768919098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Capy-Chat has a tool to meddle with your game – Chaos Mode. Viewers can manipulate the game logic by voting in chat, either giving you a much-needed boost or making things even harder. Will they help you beat the game? Or will they be cruel and try to sabotage your every attempt?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/ab8e5d58066b425d536171e486280b9c.poster.avif?t=1768919098\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/ab8e5d58066b425d536171e486280b9c.webm?t=1768919098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/ab8e5d58066b425d536171e486280b9c.mp4?t=1768919098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully Customize your StreamBara! Choose between various accessories, keyboards, mouses, backgrounds! Heck, you can even wear wacky costumes to make your chat laugh!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/3fe047fd8777bc70b27fba57fe9664b0.poster.avif?t=1768919098\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/3fe047fd8777bc70b27fba57fe9664b0.webm?t=1768919098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/3fe047fd8777bc70b27fba57fe9664b0.mp4?t=1768919098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your creativity to beat the game the fastest you can and compete with your friends in the Leaderboards. Watch players from all around the world  as they struggle to be <strong>the number 1 Giga Capy Chad in the world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect your <strong>real audience</strong> from <strong>Twitch</strong>  and let them vote! <strong>Now you really ARE a streamer!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CAPPA, a hero from capybara legend, needs your help! Your mission: free every capybara in the world from the evil clutches of Cappyland. But wait... who is that mysterious Stream-Bara lurking in the corner of the screen?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/d627cbdfb89690194b788f5f7ef48c71.poster.avif?t=1768919098\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/d627cbdfb89690194b788f5f7ef48c71.webm?t=1768919098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/d627cbdfb89690194b788f5f7ef48c71.mp4?t=1768919098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To help you complete CAPPA’s mission, you’ll use an artifact known only from ancient tales – <strong>the Ropegun</strong>. Use your fluffy body and springy rope to bounce through various traps and dangers trying to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/75d10e5d75557691a0593049b0242cab.poster.avif?t=1768919098\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/75d10e5d75557691a0593049b0242cab.webm?t=1768919098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/75d10e5d75557691a0593049b0242cab.mp4?t=1768919098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stream-Bara has gathered the Capy-Chat – the audience of his stream, reacting live to your playthrough. You can impress them by looking cool and beating the game with ease… or rage and be memed in chat! It’s all in your hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/8fd3cc79f232f2884bfa193d49641f33.poster.avif?t=1768919098\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/8fd3cc79f232f2884bfa193d49641f33.webm?t=1768919098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/8fd3cc79f232f2884bfa193d49641f33.mp4?t=1768919098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Capy-Chat has a tool to meddle with your game – Chaos Mode. Viewers can manipulate the game logic by voting in chat, either giving you a much-needed boost or making things even harder. Will they help you beat the game? Or will they be cruel and try to sabotage your every attempt?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/ab8e5d58066b425d536171e486280b9c.poster.avif?t=1768919098\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/ab8e5d58066b425d536171e486280b9c.webm?t=1768919098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/ab8e5d58066b425d536171e486280b9c.mp4?t=1768919098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully Customize your StreamBara! Choose between various accessories, keyboards, mouses, backgrounds! Heck, you can even wear wacky costumes to make your chat laugh!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/3fe047fd8777bc70b27fba57fe9664b0.poster.avif?t=1768919098\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/3fe047fd8777bc70b27fba57fe9664b0.webm?t=1768919098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651090/extras/3fe047fd8777bc70b27fba57fe9664b0.mp4?t=1768919098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your creativity to beat the game the fastest you can and compete with your friends in the Leaderboards. Watch players from all around the world  as they struggle to be <strong>the number 1 Giga Capy Chad in the world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect your <strong>real audience</strong> from <strong>Twitch</strong>  and let them vote! <strong>Now you really ARE a streamer!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
